Z||000022||ChadMan||07-30-2001||12:29 PM||||The current V6 Mustang is reasonably quick and makes 190 hp from the 3.8 V6.  But the previous gen 3.8 only made 145 hp.  I *THINK* the changeover year was 1999, so your buddy should have the weak 3.8 and you should be able to spank him easily.  <P>It would be close against the newer 190 hp Mustang, especially the 5-speed.<P>I wonder if the new Ford 3.8 still blows head gaskets like the old one did?||||reg||3
